      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<!-- TryScent &#8212; Social proof (Dino missed-bottle design, Swedish) &#8212; Custom Liquid paste block.\n     Pure HTML+CSS, scoped to .ts-proof-sv. No Liquid tags (Custom Liquid editor rejects them). -->\n\n<style>\n  .ts-proof-sv{\n    --green:#14843d;\n    --green-dark:#0f6b31;\n    --green-soft:#eaf6ee;\n    --ink:#111315;\n    --muted:#626b74;\n    --line:#e6e8e8;\n    --star:#ffb000;\n    font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n    color:var(--ink);\n    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f7f8f6);\n    padding:76px 0 53px;\n    overflow:hidden;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\n  .ts-proof-sv .container{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 36px));margin-inline:auto}\n  .ts-proof-sv .proof-head{text-align:center;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 15px}\n  .ts-proof-sv .kicker{\n    font-size:13px;\n    letter-spacing:.13em;\n    text-transform:uppercase;\n    font-weight:800;\n    color:var(--green);\n    margin-bottom:14px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .section-title{\n    font-size:clamp(26px,3.3vw,43px);\n    line-height:1.02;\n    letter-spacing:-.045em;\n    margin-bottom:12px;\n    font-weight:700;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .carousel{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:flex-start;\n    gap:22px;\n    overflow-x:auto;\n    scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;\n    scrollbar-width:none;\n    padding:8px 4px 22px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .carousel::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-card{\n    flex:0 0 calc(33.333% - 15px);\n    min-width:330px;\n    scroll-snap-align:start;\n    background:#fff;\n    border:1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius:20px;\n    padding:26px 26px 13px;\n    box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(16,34,22,.06);\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-top{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:space-between;\n    gap:14px;\n    margin-bottom:11px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-stars{color:var(--star);letter-spacing:2px;font-size:19px}\n  .ts-proof-sv .verified{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}\n  .ts-proof-sv .verified:hover{text-decoration:underline}\n  .ts-proof-sv .tp-dot{color:var(--green)}\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-card h3{\n    font-size:16px;\n    line-height:1.22;\n    letter-spacing:-.035em;\n    margin-bottom:14px;\n    font-weight:700;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-card p{\n    color:var(--muted);\n    line-height:1.62;\n    font-size:15px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-card p.result-line{\n    margin:8px 0 12px;\n    padding:15px 16px;\n    border-radius:14px;\n    background:var(--green-soft);\n    color:var(--green-dark);\n    font-weight:800;\n    font-size:14px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .person{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\n  .ts-proof-sv .person strong{display:block;font-size:14px}\n  .ts-proof-sv .person span{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.35;display:block}\n  @media (max-width:1024px){\n    .ts-proof-sv .review-card{flex-basis:48%}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:700px){\n    .ts-proof-sv{padding:30px 0 21px}\n    .ts-proof-sv .review-card{min-width:86%;flex-basis:86%}\n  }\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"ts-proof-sv\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"proof-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">D&#228;rf&#246;r fastnade de f&#246;r TryScent</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">De s&#228;ger det b&#228;ttre &#228;n vi n&#229;gonsin skulle kunna.</h2>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"carousel\">\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Jag har redan f&#229;tt flera komplimanger efter att ha anv&#228;nt dem.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Det folk m&#228;rker f&#246;rst &#228;r inte flaskan eller priset, utan hur doften f&#246;r&#228;ndrar din utstr&#229;lning.</p>\n        <p class=\"result-line\">Samma komplimanger. Ett b&#228;ttre pris.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Elin Lundqvist</strong><span>Verifierad recensent p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Den doftar EXAKT som Dior Homme Intense &#8230; n&#228;stan skr&#228;mmande likt.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Den m&#246;rka, kr&#228;miga och lyxiga karakt&#228;ren man f&#246;rv&#228;ntar sig fanns d&#228;r redan fr&#229;n f&#246;rsta sprayen.</p>\n        <p class=\"result-line\">Den v&#228;lbekanta doftupplevelsen, utan designerpriset.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Johan Bergstr&#246;m</strong><span>Verifierad recensent p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9734;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;B&#228;ttre &#228;n n&#229;gra av de dyraste parfymerna du kan k&#246;pa.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Doften &#246;vertr&#228;ffade f&#246;rv&#228;ntningarna och levererade den kvalitet man vanligtvis f&#246;rknippar med ett betydligt h&#246;gre pris.</p>\n        <p class=\"result-line\">Expensive presence. Unexpected price.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Moa</strong><span>Verifierad recensent p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Till en b&#246;rjan var jag skeptisk &#8230;&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Men n&#228;r jag gjorde min f&#246;rsta best&#228;llning uppt&#228;ckte jag att parfymerna &#228;r fantastiska och mycket lika originalparfymerna. Dessutom &#228;r priset verkligen riktigt bra. Jag kommer definitivt att forts&#228;tta handla fr&#229;n TryScent i framtiden.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Ahmad Ismail</strong><span>Recension p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Dofter som verkligen luktar som originalet.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Sitter kvar s&#229; l&#228;nge som det utlovas. Snabba leveranser och l&#229;ga priser. Kan bara s&#228;ga k&#246;p k&#246;p!</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Ingela</strong><span>Recension p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Parfymerna h&#229;ller l&#228;nge och v&#228;ldigt identiska &#10084;&#65039;&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Fick min f&#246;rsta best&#228;llning som var 6 olika parfymer, nu har jag best&#228;llt 8 stycken och ser fram emot n&#228;r dem kommer.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Samer Najmadin</strong><span>Recension p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Deras parfymer &#228;r som &#228;kta.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Try Scent gillar jag faktiskt, dom &#228;r fantastiskt. Jag har minst 20 flaskor TryScent-parfymer och anv&#228;nder bara dem &#128536;</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Nermina</strong><span>Recension p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;St&#228;mmer bra in p&#229; originaldoften &#128077;&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Dock h&#229;ller den inte i hela dagen men kommer inte ih&#229;g om originalet gjorde det heller. Har best&#228;llt 6 nya dofter och &#229;terkommer med betyg p&#229; dom &#128077;</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Dan Lindau</strong><span>Recension p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;V&#228;ldigt bra service.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Fick en flaska som l&#228;ckte lite i kragen, p&#229;talade detta, och utan tvekan skickades en ny flaska samt tv&#229; &#246;verraskningsdofter som kompensation! Mkt tacksam!</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Viktor Matsenius</strong><span>Recension p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Mer tillm&#246;tesg&#229;ende finns nog inte!&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>H&#246;rde av mig ang&#229;ende ett problem jag st&#246;tte p&#229;! Fick prata med n&#229;n som hette Eric! De hj&#228;lpte mig smidigt och var v&#228;ldigt serviceminded! Rekommenderar Tryscent.co! Stort tack!</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Tomas Ternemar</strong><span>Recension p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Fantastisk respons.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Det hade uppst&#229;tt en liten olycka med en av parfymerna jag best&#228;llt och jag mejlade f&#246;retaget. Jag fick ett snabbt svar fr&#229;n Ed och det l&#246;ste sig p&#229; b&#228;sta s&#228;tt. &#196;r s&#229; n&#246;jd med hur dom hanterade saken.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Teresa</strong><span>Recension p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9734;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;439 kr inklusive frakt f&#246;r 330 ml parfym. Inte illa.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>V&#228;ldigt bra pris, 380 kr f&#246;r 6 styck 50 ml parfymflaskor och fick &#228;ven med en gratis mysteryflaska i 30 ml.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Sadek Abduljalil</strong><span>Recension p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Mycket n&#246;jd med hur de doftar.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Har nu f&#229;tt mina varor. Det var v&#228;l paketerat och fick bra information kring hur det gick med leveransen.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Christian Edvardsson</strong><span>Recension p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
